 "subs": [
  {
   "id": "l01_0",
   "line": "l01",
   "text": "Turn off every light. Your phone still knows your face.",
   "t0": 0.45,
   "t1": 3.99
  },
  {
   "id": "l02_1",
   "line": "l02",
   "text": "How? It never needed your light. It brings its own.",
   "t0": 4.85,
   "t1": 8.29
  },
  {
   "id": "l03_2",
   "line": "l03",
   "text": "At the top of the screen, there are three tiny parts.",
   "t0": 9.05,
   "t1": 12.21
  },
  {
   "id": "l03_3",
   "line": "l03",
   "text": "A flood light, a dot projector, and a camera.",
   "t0": 12.55,
   "t1": 15.61
  },
  {
   "id": "l04_4",
   "line": "l04",
   "text": "All three work in infrared.",
   "t0": 16.45,
   "t1": 17.61
  },
  {
   "id": "l04_5",
   "line": "l04",
   "text": "Light just past red, which your eyes can't see.",
   "t0": 17.65,
   "t1": 21.87
  },
  {
   "id": "l05_6",
   "line": "l05",
   "text": "First, the flood light washes your face in infrared.",
   "t0": 22.85,
   "t1": 26.45
  },
  {
   "id": "l05_7",
   "line": "l05",
   "text": "Like a flash you can't see.",
   "t0": 26.49,
   "t1": 28.29
  },
  {
   "id": "l06_8",
   "line": "l06",
   "text": "The camera takes a picture, in the dark.",
   "t0": 28.85,
   "t1": 31.37
  },
  {
   "id": "l07_9",
   "line": "l07",
   "text": "But a picture can be fooled.",
   "t0": 32.25,
   "t1": 34.05
  },
  {
   "id": "l07_10",
   "line": "l07",
   "text": "So the projector fires more than 30,000 dots.",
   "t0": 34.09,
   "t1": 37.43
  },
  {
   "id": "l08_11",
   "line": "l08",
   "text": "On a flat wall, the dots land in a grid. On a face, they bend.",
   "t0": 40.85,
   "t1": 45.39
  },
  {
   "id": "l08_12",
   "line": "l08",
   "text": "Around your nose, your eyes, your cheeks.",
   "t0": 45.75,
   "t1": 48.05
  },
  {
   "id": "l09_13",
   "line": "l09",
   "text": "The camera measures how far each dot moved, and turns it into depth.",
   "t0": 49.05,
   "t1": 53.55
  },
  {
   "id": "l09_14",
   "line": "l09",
   "text": "A 3D map of your face.",
   "t0": 53.75,
   "t1": 55.73
  },
  {
   "id": "l10_15",
   "line": "l10",
   "text": "A printed photo is flat. Its dots don't bend.",
   "t0": 56.85,
   "t1": 60.05
  },
  {
   "id": "l10_16",
   "line": "l10",
   "text": "No depth, no unlock.",
   "t0": 60.41,
   "t1": 62.21
  },
  {
   "id": "l11_17",
   "line": "l11",
   "text": "Your map matches the one stored inside the phone. And it opens.",
   "t0": 63.45,
   "t1": 67.65
  },
  {
   "id": "l12_18",
   "line": "l12",
   "text": "In the dark, your phone was lighting you up the whole time.",
   "t0": 68.85,
   "t1": 72.31
  },
  {
   "id": "l12_19",
   "line": "l12",
   "text": "You just couldn't see it.",
   "t0": 72.55,
   "t1": 74.35
  }
 ],
